  "rationale": "The plant automata G model the robot's perception (sensor outcomes) and motion commands. The specification E binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative obstacle recovery and rapid return to exploration. Only one controllable is enabled per decision state, and recovery is minimal and directed. Full rotation is used only as a last resort after repeated blockages.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception and motion; perception models uncontrollable sensor events, motion models controllable actions.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, progress-maximizing policy: forward/random_walk in clear, directed recovery on obstacles, full_rotate only after repeated recovery failures, and rapid return to exploration after path_clear."
